# ShiftSentinel environment variables
# -----------------------------------
# ShiftSentinel reads NO environment variables. This file exists so
# contributors can see that at a glance instead of hunting for some.
#
# All runtime settings come from:
#   1. Command-line flags        (run: shiftsentinel --help)
#   2. An optional JSON config   (see config.example.json,
#                                 load it with: --config config.json)
#
# There are no API keys, tokens, or secrets to set up.
